Z||000008||My7Fieros||11-27-2000||09:16 PM||||Dude! Scroll to the bottom of the page and download PIP! PICS! PICS! PICS! PICS! PICS! ||||reg||1
Z||000009||Eric_PA||11-27-2000||10:18 PM||||I will have the pics on tomorrow. scanning them tonight. You people will think that I am crazy after seeing what it looked like before. I forgot to say when the roll back truck delivered it to my house, I had to use a jack to roll it off the truck since the drive axles where missing. The wheel bearings would not let it roll backwards. It hurt to see better ones in the local bone yards, but it made it to see the road again.<P>Eric<BR>Black 86.5 Fastback<BR>Red 84 4 Speed<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000010||Eric_PA||12-11-2000||10:40 PM||||Sorry it took so long to get pics back. Just that with school and not knowing how to post pics took me a while.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero84-1_3.jpg">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero84-2_1.jpg">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero84-3.jpg">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero84-4.jpg">   <P>This project was put on a hold over the summer because the automatic trans died in my 86 GT. As you can see in the  pic below I used my sunfire to haul a used trans that I had rebuilt and put in a shift kit. It's the 3.33 fdr tranny. I think it's time for a truck<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero3_3.jpg">   <P>Ok I'm so happy i can post pics. I have so many of them. Well here is the trans after rebuild.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trans.jpg">  <P>Was this a good way to drop the engine. notice how I had it raised. I'm into safety.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero1_5.jpg">  <P>I'm still looking for an after pic of my 84. Will post it when found<P><p>[This message has been edited by Eric_PA (edited 12-11-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000011||Eric_PA||12-11-2000||11:19 PM||||Well I found two after pics of the 84. I don't have my digital camera right now, so I have to wait to get newer pics. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/after1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/after2.jpg"> <P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000012||Cheever2||12-11-2000||11:43 PM||||I'm glad SOMEBODY has that much motivation.<BR>Looks like you're really making good things happen.  Keep it up.<P>Say, I saw a website or two that said it's easier to pull the engine out the top.  If I find it again I'll post it... any comments on that subject?<BR>||||reg||6
